! DBG113N.DBG - a second STEP/RETURN (README.md): STEP/RETURN in SUBD is
! interrupted by a break in SUBB2; STEP/RETURN there; then GO. Does SUBD's
! return still stop?
SET BREAK IND
SET BREAK SUBB2
GO
STEP/RETURN
SHOW CALLS
!> The second STEP/RETURN
STEP/RETURN
SHOW CALLS
!> GO after it
GO
SHOW CALLS
EXAMINE .PC
CANCEL BREAK/ALL
